[
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 14.654,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.154,
    "end": 22.919,
    "text": "Take a moment to arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.319,
    "end": 27.78,
    "text": "Right here, right where you are."
  },
  {
    "start": 37.78,
    "end": 40.334,
    "text": "Sit or stand so you feel steady,"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.734,
    "end": 44.457,
    "text": "and let your eyes close."
  },
  {
    "start": 54.457,
    "end": 55.99,
    "text": "Take a deep breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 59.59,
    "end": 61.448,
    "text": "And let it all the way out."
  },
  {
    "start": 71.448,
    "end": 72.748,
    "text": "Feel your feet."
  },
  {
    "start": 75.148,
    "end": 77.238,
    "text": "Feel the ground holding you."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.638,
    "end": 81.914,
    "text": "It's been holding you all along."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.914,
    "end": 94.097,
    "text": "Think of one small moment"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.497,
    "end": 99.077,
    "text": "when you found your way through something."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.077,
    "end": 110.702,
    "text": "Maybe you took a step."
  },
  {
    "start": 113.102,
    "end": 114.588,
    "text": "Maybe you rested."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.988,
    "end": 118.846,
    "text": "Maybe you asked for help."
  },
  {
    "start": 125.346,
    "end": 128.457,
    "text": "Take a moment to acknowledge that part of yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 138.457,
    "end": 140.779,
    "text": "That courage lives in your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 143.179,
    "end": 145.819,
    "text": "Feel it as weight, and warmth,"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.219,
    "end": 150.495,
    "text": "low and steady at your center."
  },
  {
    "start": 160.495,
    "end": 164.21,
    "text": "With each breath, let that steadiness grow."
  },
  {
    "start": 166.61,
    "end": 169.954,
    "text": "Like a mountain settling deeper into the earth."
  },
  {
    "start": 176.454,
    "end": 178.915,
    "text": "Now, bring your attention inward."
  },
  {
    "start": 181.315,
    "end": 183.637,
    "text": "Feel the center of your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 186.037,
    "end": 187.709,
    "text": "And notice what's there."
  },
  {
    "start": 197.709,
    "end": 198.731,
    "text": "A warmth."
  },
  {
    "start": 201.131,
    "end": 202.431,
    "text": "A stillness."
  },
  {
    "start": 204.831,
    "end": 207.246,
    "text": "Something quiet and alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 217.246,
    "end": 219.475,
    "text": "Let that warmth become heat."
  },
  {
    "start": 221.875,
    "end": 223.872,
    "text": "Like a fire in a hearth."
  },
  {
    "start": 226.272,
    "end": 227.935,
    "text": "Steady, and warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 237.935,
    "end": 239.684,
    "text": "Feel it low in your belly."
  },
  {
    "start": 242.084,
    "end": 244.063,
    "text": "Rising through your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 246.463,
    "end": 248.553,
    "text": "Into the palms of your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 258.553,
    "end": 260.225,
    "text": "This is your strength."
  },
  {
    "start": 266.725,
    "end": 271.09,
    "text": "Imagine this space in your chest beginning to glow."
  },
  {
    "start": 273.49,
    "end": 275.301,
    "text": "A soft, golden light."
  },
  {
    "start": 277.701,
    "end": 278.63,
    "text": "Steady."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.03,
    "end": 281.935,
    "text": "Warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 284.335,
    "end": 285.264,
    "text": "Certain."
  },
  {
    "start": 295.264,
    "end": 296.843,
    "text": "Feel it expanding."
  },
  {
    "start": 299.243,
    "end": 301.466,
    "text": "Growing brighter with each breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 303.866,
    "end": 308.092,
    "text": "Filling your chest, your throat, your shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 318.092,
    "end": 320.431,
    "text": "There's nothing forced about this."
  },
  {
    "start": 322.831,
    "end": 324.038,
    "text": "It's yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 326.438,
    "end": 328.249,
    "text": "It's always been yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 334.749,
    "end": 336.235,
    "text": "You are powerful."
  },
  {
    "start": 342.735,
    "end": 345.536,
    "text": "There's room to be gentle with yourself, too."
  },
  {
    "start": 352.036,
    "end": 354.683,
    "text": "Now, see yourself moving through tomorrow."
  },
  {
    "start": 357.083,
    "end": 360.148,
    "text": "With this light still glowing in your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 370.148,
    "end": 372.47,
    "text": "See yourself walking into a room"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.87,
    "end": 377.141,
    "text": "and feeling completely at ease."
  },
  {
    "start": 387.141,
    "end": 390.206,
    "text": "Speaking with a voice that's calm and clear."
  },
  {
    "start": 396.706,
    "end": 399.4,
    "text": "Making decisions from a place of knowing,"
  },
  {
    "start": 401.8,
    "end": 403.379,
    "text": "rather than fear."
  },
  {
    "start": 413.379,
    "end": 415.041,
    "text": "Because you're grounded."
  },
  {
    "start": 421.541,
    "end": 424.188,
    "text": "Now, let the images soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.588,
    "end": 428.399,
    "text": "Feel yourself here again."
  },
  {
    "start": 430.799,
    "end": 432.285,
    "text": "Breathing easily."
  },
  {
    "start": 442.285,
    "end": 445.071,
    "text": "The light in your chest is still glowing."
  },
  {
    "start": 451.571,
    "end": 453.521,
    "text": "Take one more deep breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 457.121,
    "end": 459.582,
    "text": "And a long, slow exhale."
  },
  {
    "start": 469.582,
    "end": 471.904,
    "text": "Wiggle your fingers and toes."
  },
  {
    "start": 481.904,
    "end": 484.969,
    "text": "And when you're ready, let your eyes open."
  },
  {
    "start": 491.469,
    "end": 492.862,
    "text": "Carry this with you."
  },
  {
    "start": 499.362,
    "end": 500.987,
    "text": "Thank you for being here."
  }
]
